  "handoff": {
    "plan": "starter_template:\n  mode: none\n  rationale: The client mockups define a custom three-roller printing puzzle over the camera; no\n    catalog template covers an order-sensitive layer-reveal, so build from scratch reusing the\n    Mamamy kit (intro, record start, result, confetti).\nmechanic_rationale: \"Mockups MMM SBD Effect 5 1-5 and SAI MAU 1-2 plus the user's answers: tap a\n  roller, it rolls across the pack and prints its layer; correct order white -> pattern -> pink logo\n  wins; any out-of-order roller floods the pack (pink or green) and loses; no timer.\"\ngame_type:\n  camera_feed: visible\n  ar_tracking: none\n  core_loop_seconds: 2\n  total_duration_seconds: 10\ncamera_feed_constraints:\n  tracking_type: none\n  tracking_range: not applicable - camera feed is only the backdrop\n  user_image_visible: true\n  composition: none\nmechanic:\n  class: other\n  description: \"An empty wet-wipes pack outline sits mid-screen with three print rollers around it:\n    white on the left, tropical pattern below, pink on top. A thumbnail of the finished pack sits\n    top-left as the target. Tapping a roller makes it roll across the pack and reveal its layer\n    along the roll. Correct order: white base, then the tropical print, then the pink Mamamy logo;\n    each used roller disappears. Picking pink or pattern before its turn floods the whole pack in\n    that colour (pink or green) and after about a second shows TIẾC QUÁ! with PLAY AGAIN. Finishing\n    the pack shows the MAMAMY TOWER 19 logo with confetti and PLAY AGAIN. No timer.\"\n  parameters:\n    rollers: 3\n    order:\n      - white\n      - pattern\n      - pink\n    roll_sec: 0.8\n    lose_delay_sec: 1\nscreens:\n  - name: Intro\n    role: intro\n    initial_visible: true\n    layout:\n      - id: intro_hint\n        element: brand text 'In bao bì giống mẫu nhé!' + rule line\n        position: inside the pack outline\n        kind: hud\n      - id: intro_button\n        element: brand pink pill RECORD TO PLAY\n        position: inside the pack outline, below the hint\n        kind: button\n        interactive: true\n  - name: Gameplay\n    role: gameplay\n    initial_visible: true\n    layout:\n      - id: thumb\n        element: finished pack thumbnail\n        position: top-left\n        kind: hud\n      - id: pack\n        element: pack outline + printed layers\n        position: centre, y=-78\n        kind: playable\n      - id: rollers\n        element: white (left), pattern (bottom), pink (top) print rollers\n        position: around the pack\n        kind: playable\n        interactive: true\n  - name: Result\n    role: result\n    initial_visible: false\n    layout:\n      - id: result_logo\n        element: MAMAMY TOWER 19 logo (win)\n        position: center\n        kind: result\n      - id: result_lose\n        element: TIẾC QUÁ! title (lose) over the ruined pack\n        position: above the pack\n        kind: result\n      - id: retry_button\n        element: pink pill PLAY AGAIN\n        position: below logo / pack\n        kind: button\n        interactive: true\n      - id: confetti\n        element: Sparkly Confetti (win only)\n        position: full screen\n        kind: decoration\ninteractions:\n  - kind: record_start_reset\n    trigger: APJS.EventType.RecordStart\n    response: Fresh pack, three rollers, start\n    state_change: any -> PLAYING\n    target:\n      scope: none\n      rationale: global lifecycle event\n  - kind: screen_transition\n    trigger: tap RECORD TO PLAY\n    response: Same as record start\n    state_change: INTRO -> PLAYING\n    target:\n      scope: screen_element\n      screen_element_ids:\n        - intro_button\n    feedback:\n      visual: intro hides\n  - kind: gameplay_action\n    trigger: tap a roller\n    response: Roller rolls across the pack revealing its layer (right one) or flooding the pack (wrong one)\n    state_change: PLAYING -> ROLLING -> PLAYING / WIN / LOSE\n    target:\n      scope: screen_element\n      screen_element_ids:\n        - rollers\n        - pack\n    feedback:\n      visual: roller pops, rolls, layer wipes in along the roll, roller fades\n  - kind: retry\n    trigger: tap anywhere on RESULT after 1.3s\n    response: Restart\n    state_change: RESULT -> PLAYING\n    target:\n      scope: screen_element\n      screen_element_ids:\n        - retry_button\n    feedback:\n      visual: result hides\nassets:\n  - id: asset.rollers\n    role: print rollers\n    description: \"Three roller stamps: white (left, vertical), tropical pattern (bottom), pink (top)\"\n    is_background: false\n    count: 3\n    animated: false\n    coverage: partial\n    interactive_role: addressable_part\n    kind: visual\n  - id: asset.pack\n    role: pack states\n    description: Pack outline, white base, printed, printed+logo, flooded green, flooded pink\n    is_background: false\n    count: 6\n    animated: false\n    coverage: partial\n    interactive_role: decoration\n    kind: visual\n  - id: asset.logo\n    role: win logo\n    description: MAMAMY TOWER 19 logo in pink and mauve 3D letters with a 19 shield, shown on the win screen\n    is_background: false\n    count: 1\n    animated: false\n    coverage: partial\n    interactive_role: decoration\n    kind: visual\nrandom_behaviors: []\ncriteria:\n  - category: layout\n    check: Rollers, pack and thumbnail sit where mockup 1 puts them\n  - category: state\n    check: Correct order prints white, pattern, logo and shows the win screen\n  - category: state\n    check: An out-of-order roller floods the pack pink/green and shows TIẾC QUÁ! + PLAY AGAIN\n  - category: state\n    check: Used rollers disappear; rollers ignore taps while one is rolling\n  - category: camera_feed\n    check: Camera feed visible\n  - category: layout\n    check: Win screen shows the MAMAMY TOWER 19 logo, confetti and PLAY AGAIN; lose screen shows TIẾC\n      QUÁ! and PLAY AGAIN\nscene_representation:\n  planning_mode: explicit\n  decision_summary: Flat 2D screen-space scene over the camera feed; one APJS script handles taps,\n    roller tweens and Filled-image wipes.\n  space:\n    kind: screen\n    description: 720x1280 ScreenTransform space\n  content_form:\n    kind: flat_2d\n    description: PNG sprites on Screen Images\n  requirements:\n    - id: req.order\n      description: Order-sensitive printing with win/lose\n      must: true\n      layer_refs:\n        - layer.game\n        - layer.ui\n      verification_refs:\n        - ver.flow\n    - id: req.camera\n      description: Camera feed visible\n      must: true\n      layer_refs:\n        - layer.camera\n      verification_refs:\n        - ver.flow\n  layers:\n    - id: layer.game\n      role: gameplay\n      description: Pack, rollers, thumbnail\n      space:\n        kind: screen\n        description: screen\n      content_form:\n        kind: flat_2d\n        description: flat_2d\n      requirement_refs:\n        - req.order\n    - id: layer.ui\n      role: overlays\n      description: Intro, result, confetti\n      space:\n        kind: screen\n        description: screen\n      content_form:\n        kind: flat_2d\n        description: flat_2d\n      requirement_refs:\n        - req.order\n    - id: layer.camera\n      role: backdrop\n      description: Camera feed\n      space:\n        kind: screen\n        description: screen\n      content_form:\n        kind: camera_feed\n        description: camera_feed\n      requirement_refs:\n        - req.camera\n  verification:\n    - id: ver.flow\n      description: Taps via interact_by_dsl and demo mode recordings\n      requirement_refs:\n        - req.order\n        - req.camera\n      views_or_states:\n        - intro\n        - playing\n        - rolling\n        - win\n        - lose\n      success_criteria: |-\n        layers wipe in\n        wrong roller floods and loses\n        win shows logo + confetti\n  fallbacks:\n    unknown_requirement: adapt_and_verify\n    unmet_must: stop_and_explain\nplan_type: game\n",
    "template": {
      "status": "none",
      "rationale": "The client mockups define a custom three-roller printing puzzle over the camera; no catalog template covers an order-sensitive layer-reveal, so build from scratch reusing the Mamamy kit (intro, record start, result, confetti).",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-28T16:10:15.597Z"
    },
